{"repositoryId":1350799020,"availability":"available","full":"pushkar-anand/jocasta","name":"jocasta","description":"Network device inventory: identifies devices by MAC address, reads your router's ARP and DHCP tables and flow exports, and keeps a change history. Single Go binary with a web UI.","category":"Business","language":"Go","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-29T17:53:37Z","updated":"2026-10-19T10:23:57Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pushkar-anand.github.io/jocasta/","topics":["arp","asset-management","device-discovery","dhcp","golang","homelab","htmx","icmp","mikrotik","network-inventory","network-monitoring","network-scanner","routeros","self-hosted","sqlite"],"demo":"https://pushkar-anand.github.io/jocasta/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Jocasta keeps an inventory of the devices on your network. It recognises each device by its hardware address, so a device keeps its label and notes when its IP changes, and it logs every change it sees. Connect your router and Jocasta also identifies devices on other VLANs and shows who each device talks to. It runs as a single binary with a web interface.","Pre-1.0 and under active development. A release can change the configuration format, the database schema or the HTTP API with no upgrade path. Pin to a version and check the release notes before moving to the next."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pushkar-anand/jocasta/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1677811b4a0f7af93f4a11899082b43ae7bb0d4f20e9bb9bf196270904fe6d7e","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T13:41:38.700Z","projectInsights":{"version"